    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2389660/extras/ae66dd8761007c92b3df8fbe4745b541.avif?t=1734092884\" /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Farkas: the Last Redhaft is a Story-Rich rogue-like game with RPG mechanics. </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2389660/extras/0c8764ef13db188069045179fd69f5b0.poster.avif?t=1734092884\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2389660/extras/0c8764ef13db188069045179fd69f5b0.webm?t=1734092884\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The land of your ancestors is under occupation and all the responsibility is on you! By the king's order, you set out south to end the goblin invasion, but the roads you knew by heart are now unrecognizable and dangerous.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Create your own path in combat! </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Which path will you prioritize? Cat, Bear, Swordsman or Goat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2389660/extras/245cde94e7b849e3abd2ee693ec8ab84.avif?t=1734092884\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SMASH the enemies with the most brutal finishers!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dance with your enemies with unique animations and rapid combat mechanics!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2389660/extras/2bbb5ce09b22abb7e7817edbf1446eee.poster.avif?t=1734092884\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2389660/extras/2bbb5ce09b22abb7e7817edbf1446eee.apng?t=1734092884\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>-</strong> Discover Hesperia with beautiful hand-drawn pixel art</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>-</strong> Controller Supported!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>-</strong> Upgrade your gear with mining and gathering</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>-</strong> 10+ boss fights and 30+ different enemies</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2389660/extras/ae66dd8761007c92b3df8fbe4745b541.avif?t=1734092884\" /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Farkas: the Last Redhaft is a Story-Rich rogue-like game with RPG mechanics. </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2389660/extras/0c8764ef13db188069045179fd69f5b0.poster.avif?t=1734092884\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2389660/extras/0c8764ef13db188069045179fd69f5b0.webm?t=1734092884\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The land of your ancestors is under occupation and all the responsibility is on you! By the king's order, you set out south to end the goblin invasion, but the roads you knew by heart are now unrecognizable and dangerous.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Create your own path in combat! </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Which path will you prioritize? Cat, Bear, Swordsman or Goat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2389660/extras/245cde94e7b849e3abd2ee693ec8ab84.avif?t=1734092884\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SMASH the enemies with the most brutal finishers!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dance with your enemies with unique animations and rapid combat mechanics!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2389660/extras/2bbb5ce09b22abb7e7817edbf1446eee.poster.avif?t=1734092884\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2389660/extras/2bbb5ce09b22abb7e7817edbf1446eee.apng?t=1734092884\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>-</strong> Discover Hesperia with beautiful hand-drawn pixel art</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>-</strong> Controller Supported!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>-</strong> Upgrade your gear with mining and gathering</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>-</strong> 10+ boss fights and 30+ different enemies</p>",
    "short_description": "As the last survivor of the dojo, the responsibility is on you. Parkour your way through the most dangerous mines. Slash the enemies in the forest and master the art of the sword.",
